  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CO-506696</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to contribute to Vietnam&#x2019;s efforts in achieving NDCs and Net Zero targets through influence government and key stakeholders for scaling up low carbon rice production and other GHG reduction initiatives in Vietnam.
Expectedoutcomes:
&#x2022; Outcome 1: The detailed provincial master plans for low carbon rice production in Mekong Delta region will be developed, approved and allocated resources by provincial authorities ensuring sustainability of low carbon rice production practices in the provinces
&#x2022; Outcome 2: The MRV system for measuring GHG emission in rice sector in Vietnam will be developed and applied widely in the country based on the digital tool (Rice Hero apps) and linked with Climate and Environment BusinessIndex (CEBI) initiatives
&#x2022; Outcome 3: The public and private investments for low carbon agriculture/rice production will be increased and used inclusively and effectively</narrative>
  </description>
